    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You found yourself on <strong>Ehko</strong>, a remote Island primarily inhabited by former fashion models, influencers, and dancers\u2014island girls who are naturally sculpted, their skin bronzed by the sun and seas, their legs long and toned, and their feet deliciously perfect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The men? They\u2019ve traded in real women for <strong>AI-generated girlfriends</strong>\u2014obedient replicas who cater to their every desire without question or the need for consent. AI has also automated nearly every job on Ehko, leaving the population few paths to success or fulfillment of their dreams. But the last straw for you was the new <strong>OnlyAI</strong> law, which made it illegal to shoot photographs, allowing only AI-generated images to stop face-swapping, catfishing, and other forms of identity theft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somehow, only you saw what this really was\u2014AI slowly erasing real connection, numbing everyone\u2019s senses, and crushing ambition. <strong>Only you</strong> understood it was the beginning of a silent apocalypse\u2014the quiet, inevitable end of human desire and expression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a\u00a0<strong>photographer</strong>, you know the power of true art. It has the ability to reflect who we are, confront what we\u2019ve become, and envision what we could be. This led you to believe  capturing the rawest, most honest photographic art, could spark a revolution that would wake people from their AI-induced\u00a0slumber.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your quest, should you choose to accept it</strong>, is to seek out the most intoxicating women on Ehko\u2026. seduce them into moments of honesty and intimacy\u2026 and capture the visual pulse of their beauty and lust in art... to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ehko Island is a Kinetic Visual Novel: A sub-category of <strong><i>Visual Novels</i></strong> that averts the tradition of having Multiple Endings and instead focuses on a singular, linear plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You navigate through an interactive map of the island, unlocking 32 scenes and over 2000 renders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seductive female narrator will guide you through the experience, reading every line of text directly to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a leg and foot fetish that affects what you look at, and how you see the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore the sexual freedom and shared loneliness of the women of Ehko living under the oppressive rule of an AI-obsessed government.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You form new relationships with the island\u2019s most intriguing women\u2014while confronting your own inner hangups. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And along the way, you\u2019ll catch glimpses of other stories of life on Ehko, in short vignettes, with more to unfold in future DLCs.</p></li></ul>",
